  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Bows</p>\n<p><em>“What’s so hard to understand about ‘swish, swish, stab’?”</em></p>\n<p>Attaching this attachment requires a DV17 Weaponstech Skill Check. Only one Bladed Limbs may be installed. As an Action, a user can install or uninstall any Melee Weapon (that need not be concealable before its installation) provided by the user into the weapon. The Melee Weapon can only be concealed if it and the Bow are both already Concealable.</p>\n<p>Swapping between the Bow and installed Melee Weapon does not take an Action, but can only be done at the start of the user’s Turn before they make an Attack with either weapon. Attachments and Mods on one weapon do not affect the other, but BODY requirements to wield or utilize either weapon or their functions do affect the other (i.e., an installed Melee Weapon with a BODY 11 requirement makes the Bow also require BODY 11 to be wielded).</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Internal Components).</em></p>"
